  "story": {
    "text": "Emma pays a dutiful call on talkative Miss Bates and her old mother, and must hear every word of a {LETTER} from her niece, Jane Fairfax. Jane is coming to stay! She is {ELEGANT}, {ACCOMPLISHED}, and so {RESERVED} that Emma has never liked her. And Miss Bates, {SEARCHING} her {BASKET}: “Oh, here it is.”",
